OL,3,GNEWSACar tax conviction against mayor
OL,4,Awithdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car tax conviction against the Mayor
OL,7,Fof London Sir Sadiq Khan has been
OL,8,Fformally withdrawn after he was
OL,9,Fcriminally prosecuted for not taxing a
OL,10,F24-year-old Nissan Micra he did not
OL,11,Fown.
OL,13,FThe DVLA requested the withdrawal at
OL,14,FHereford Magistrates' Court on Thursday
OL,15,Fafter the mayor's team said the
OL,16,Fconviction was the result of a "scam".
OL,18,FThe Labour politician, 55, was found
OL,19,Fguilty of keeping an unlicensed vehicle
OL,20,Fby a magistrate last month in a
OL,21,Fcriminal prosecution brought by the
OL,22,FDVLA.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
