OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the mayor said it
OL,7,Fwas "not the first time" Khan had been
OL,8,Fvictim of a scam involving people
OL,9,Ffalsely stating that he was the owner
OL,10,Fof a vehicle.
